  - id: help-reaping
    group: 0
    icon: {fileID: 5850598286787540372}
    title:
      key: help.reaping.title
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: Reaping & Returning
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.reaping.title
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    body:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "<b>River, Woods and Mines</b>\nCarl ends your run at the distance limit. Being reaped at that limit increases your shared reaping distance by 1%.\n\n<b>Farmlands</b>\nCarl ends your run at the distance limit, but reaping gives no distance increase.\n\n<b>Spooky</b>\nEnemy levels rise with your kills. There is no kill cap or distance reaping limit.\n\nYou keep gathered resources and skill progress when a run ends. Return to town to turn in quests, and check the <link=\"help:run-summary\"><u><color=#EFB889>Run Summary</color></u></link> to see your gains. Map information is in <link=\"help:statistics/general\"><u><color=#EFB889>Statistics \u2192 General</color></u></link>."
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.reaping.body
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    details:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: '<b>River, Woods and Mines</b>

        Being reaped at the distance limit increases your shared reaping distance by 1% of the effective limit reached, including distance buffs. Some quests also let you travel farther.


        <b>Farmlands</b>

        Carl ends the run at its distance limit, but being reaped gives no distance increase.


        <b>Spooky</b>

        Enemy levels rise as you get more kills. There is no kill cap or distance reaping limit.'
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.reaping.details
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    illustrations:
    - sprite: {fileID: 5850598286787540372}
      buff: {fileID: 0}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Carl
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.reaping.art.0
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: "<b>Carl</b>\nCarl ends your run at the map\u2019s distance limit. You keep gathered resources and skill progress.\n\nRiver, Woods and Mines gain 1% distance when Carl reaps you at the limit. Farmlands gives no increase. Spooky scales with kills and has no distance reaping limit."
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.reaping.art.0.description
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
