  - id: help-retreating
    group: 0
    icon: {fileID: -757387047, guid: 2d1ea1fa2e7dca4448ad7af961b8896b, type: 3}
    title:
      key: help.retreating.title
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "Resource bonus"
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.retreating.title
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    body:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "Each kill adds 0.02\u00d7 to your resource multiplier, up to 10\u00d7. The multiplier carries over when you die, are reaped, or retry without returning to town.\n\nReturning to town applies it once to the resources gathered since you last left town. Your next outing starts at 1\u00d7."
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.retreating.body
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    details:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "For example, 50 kills give 2\u00d7 resources; 450 kills reach the 10\u00d7 cap. Bonus resources do not earn another bonus."
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.retreating.details
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    illustrations: []
    referenceColumns: []
    referenceRows: []
    expanded: 0
    visibility: []
  - id: help-forge
    group: 1
    icon: {fileID: 2895363419561144551}
    title:
      key: help.forge.title
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: Forge
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.forge.title
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    body:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "After meeting Ivan, open <link=\"help:forge\"><u><color=#EFB889>Town \u2192 Forge</color></u></link>.\n\n1. Smelt the required materials into ingots.\n2. Select a core to set the rarity chances and material costs.\n3. Select an equipment slot, then Craft. Each craft uses ingots and one core.\n4. Compare the result. Select Equip to replace your current item.\n\nOutside Ivan\u2019s lesson, a crafted item equips automatically if its slot is empty."
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.forge.body
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    details:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "<b>Salvage</b>\nReview your result before crafting again or switching slots: either action salvages an unequipped result.\n\n<b>Automation \u2014 <link=\"help:forge\"><u><color=#EFB889>Forge</color></u></link> mastery level 3</b>\nCraft Until Upgrade keeps crafting, spending materials on every attempt.\n\nStop for Vathrium stops on any Vathrium result, even a downgrade.\n\nWith Stat Matching on, an upgrade must also have the same stat types as your equipped item before crafting stops.\n\nSee <link=\"help:skills/Combat\"><u><color=#EFB889>Hub \u2192 Skills \u2192 Combat</color></u></link> for core and crystal unlocks."
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.forge.details
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    illustrations:
    - sprite: {fileID: 8925258338319069828, guid: f84262455b69072498ba0e2afc130d21, type: 3}
      buff: {fileID: 0}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Ingot
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.forge.art.0
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: '<b>Ingots</b>

          Smelt the listed materials into ingots. Your selected core determines which ingots a craft needs and how many. Smelting makes materials; Craft makes equipment.'
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.forge.art.0.description
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
    - sprite: {fileID: 791382025818577539, guid: 9a7553022bc32ea4cab234021aded58a, type: 3}
      buff: {fileID: 0}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Core
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.forge.art.1
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: "<b>Cores</b>\nEach craft uses one core. Your selected core sets the rarity chances and material costs. Higher core tiers unlock through Combat levels. Use the <link=\"help:forge\"><u><color=#EFB889>Forge</color></u></link>\u2019s conversion controls to upgrade cores."
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.forge.art.1.description
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
    - sprite: {fileID: 5064720189575774579, guid: fffb6aee16bdecb4cb3248697c59ee9f, type: 3}
      buff: {fileID: 0}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Sword
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.forge.art.2
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: '<b>Sword</b>

          Select Weapon, then Craft. Every weapon has a damage stat. Compare the result, then select Equip to replace your current weapon.


          Crafting again or switching slots salvages an unequipped result.'
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.forge.art.2.description
          m_FallbackState: 0
