  - id: help-echoes
    group: 2
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 27afd0a9708dae942b5fcb9f60c65dff, type: 3}
    title:
      key: help.echoes.title
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: Echoes
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.echoes.title
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    body:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: "Echoes are temporary copies of your hero that gather resources or fight enemies.\n\nOrin\u2019s realms are connected. Surges of temporal energy let Echoes of your past cross between them to help you. Helping the townsfolk lets you summon Echoes yourself.\n\nEchoes unlocked through a skill\u2019s milestones seek tasks for that skill. See <link=\"help:skills\"><u><color=#EFB889>Hub \u2192 Skills</color></u></link> for milestones, or the <link=\"help:buffs\"><u><color=#EFB889>summoning buff</color></u></link> for its effects."
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.echoes.body
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    details:
      key:
      bold: 0
      smallCaps: 0
      fallback: An Echo that can both gather and fight prioritizes tasks, then fights when engaged.
      localized:
        m_TableReference:
          m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
        m_TableEntryReference:
          m_KeyId: 0
          m_Key: help.echoes.details
        m_FallbackState: 0
        m_WaitForCompletion: 0
        m_LocalVariables: []
    illustrations:
    - sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 27afd0a9708dae942b5fcb9f60c65dff, type: 3}
      buff: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f17a13066cddffd48894dc414bebf6d1, type: 2}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Task Echo
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.echoes.art.0
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: "<b>Task Echo</b>\nGathers resources without attacking or attracting enemies. Echoes unlocked through a skill\u2019s milestones seek tasks for that skill. <link=\"help:skills\"><u><color=#EFB889>Check the milestone</color></u></link> or <link=\"help:buffs\"><u><color=#EFB889>summoning buff</color></u></link> for its duration and abilities.\n\nThe current summon\u2019s effects, duration and cooldown are shown below."
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.echoes.art.0.description
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
    - sprite: {fileID: 7218046035808895280, guid: 16b9f4cabb88e55479fb4cb5a33be70d, type: 3}
      buff: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2fc3ccddf9f9de4189bdebaf3a184a6, type: 2}
      caption:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: Combat Echo
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.echoes.art.1
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
          m_LocalVariables: []
      description:
        key:
        bold: 0
        smallCaps: 0
        fallback: "<b>Combat Echo</b>\nSeeks out enemies and fights them. Combat-only Echoes do not gather resources. An Echo that can both gather and fight prioritizes tasks, then fights when engaged.\n\nThe current summon\u2019s effects, duration and cooldown are shown below."
        localized:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: Wiki
          m_TableEntryReference:
            m_KeyId: 0
            m_Key: help.echoes.art.1.description
          m_FallbackState: 0
          m_WaitForCompletion: 0
